/target
/examples

# Editor swap files
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Binary scratch files from ORCA runs under examples/.
#
# These are 355 MB of the repository and Beavyr cannot read a single one of
# them -- there is no parser for any of these formats, and none is planned.
# The text files beside them (.xyz .out .hess .molden .engrad) are what the
# tests actually read, and those stay.
#
# NOTE: ignoring them here only stops NEW ones being added. The copies already
# committed stay in the repository until they are untracked -- see the note at
# the bottom of packaging/README.md.
*.gbw
*.cis
*.densities
*.densitiesinfo
*.mkl
*.cpcm
*.cpcm_corr
*.smd
*.smd.grd
*.carthess
*.bibtex
*.property.txt

# Cluster job leftovers
slurm-*.out

# Scratch
continue.txt

# LibreOffice/OpenOffice lock files
.~lock.*#
